(tripurabhairavīpaṃcāṃgam )
(naṃ0 - 4826)
(nāma - rudrayāmalataṃtre tripurabhairavī pañcāṅgam )
(karttā - )
(patra saṃ0 - 55 patrāṇi)
(viṣayaḥ - tatram tripurabhairavīpaṃcāṃgam )
(viśvasāroddhāre)

<pṛ0 1a> oṃśrītripurabhairavyainamaḥ ajñānatimiradhvaṃsi
saṃsārārṇavatārakaṃ ānaṃdavījamavatādatarkyaṃ
traipuraṃmahaḥ athavakṣyeparāṃvidyāṃtripurāmati
gopitāṃ yāṃjñātvāsiddhasaṃghānāmadhiyojāya
tenaraḥ viyadbhṛguhutāśasthobhautikobindu
śekharaḥ kiṃyattadādikendrāgnisthitaṃvāsākṣi
biṃdumat ākāśabhṛguvahnisthomanuḥsargendu
khaṃḍavān vāgbhavaṃprathamaṃbījaṃkāmarājaṃdvitī
yakaṃ tṛtīyaṃśaktivījākhyaṃtribhirbījairi
tīritā paṃcakūṭātmikāvidyāvidyātripura
bhairavī ṛṣiḥsyāddakṣiṇāmūrttiḥpaṃktiśchaṃ
daḥsamīritā devatādaiśikairuktādevītri
purabhairavī nābherācaraṇaṃyasyavāgbhavaṃmaṃtra
vitpunaḥ hṛdayānnābhiparyaṃtaṃkāmavījaṃpra
vinyaset śirasohṛtpradeśāntaṃtārtīyaṃvi

<pṛ0 1ba> nyasetpunaḥ ādyaṃdvitīyaṃkarayostārtīyamu
bhayornyaset mūrdhnyādhārehṛdinyasyabhūyovī
jatrayaṃkramāt navayonyātmakaṃnyāsaṃkuryā
dvījaistribhiḥkramāt karṇayościbukebhūyaḥ
śaṃkhayorvadanepunaḥ netrayonnasivinyasedaṃ
sayoḥjaṭharepunaḥ tatokūrparayokukṣaujā
nunordhvajamūrdhani pādayorguhyadeśecapārśva
yohṛdayāmbuje stanadvayokaṃṭhadeśeranyādi
satha(rva)vinyaset mūleratiṃhṛdiprītiṃbhruvorma
dhyemanobhavaṃ vālāvījaistribhinyāsaisthā
neṣveṣvavilomataḥ amṛteśīṃcaviśveśīvi
śvayoniṃkramādyamāḥ vilomabījevinyaseḥ
mūrdhninyāsamathācaret svasvavījādikaṃpū
rvaṃmūrdhnīśānaṃmanobhavaṃ nyasedvaktretatpuruṣaṃ

<pṛ0 2a> makaradhvajamātmavit hṛdighorakumārādi
kandarpaṃtadanantaraṃ guhyadeśepravinyasedvāmadevā
dimanmathaṃ sadyojātaṃkāmadevaṃpādayorvi
nyasettataḥ ūrdhvaprāgdakṣiṇodīcīpaścimeṣu
mukheṣutān pravinyasyayathāpūrvaṃbhṛguvyomā
gnisaṃsthitaḥ sadvyādipaṃcahrasvādvyobījame
ṣāṃprakīrtitaṃ ṣaṭdīrghayuktenādyenavījenāṅga
kriyāmatā paṃcabāṇāṃstanaunyasenmatrītrailo
kyamohanaṃ drāvābhyāṃ(?)drāviṇīṃmūrdhnidrītā(?)
bhyāṃkṣobhaṇīṃpade nlīṃvaśīkaraṇīṃmūrdhni
gudeklīṃbījapūrvikāṃ ākarṣaṇīṃhṛdipu
naḥsargāntabhṛgusaṃyutāṃ saṃmohanīṃkramādde
vaṃbāṇanyāsoyamīritaḥ bhālabhrūmadhyava
danakarṇikākaṃṭhahṛtsvaca nābhidhiṣṭhāna

<pṛ0 2ba> yoḥpaṃcatārādyāḥsubhagādikāḥ nyastavyā
vidhinādevyomaṃtriṇāsubhagābhagā bhaga
marpaṇyathaparābhagamālinyanantaraṃ anaṃgānaṅ 
kusumābhūyaścānaṃgamekhalā anaṃgamadanā
sarvāmadavibhramamantharāḥ pradhānadevatāva
rṇabhūṣaṇādyairalaṃkṛtāḥ akṣasrakṣu(?)stakā
bhītivaradāḍhyakarāmbujāḥ vākkāmoḥblū(?)
punaḥstrīsaḥtārāḥpaṃcoditāstvamī nyāsaṃ
kuryādbhūṣaṇākhyaṃtaṣṇā(?)tsādhakasattamaḥ 
nyāsecchirasibhālabhrūkarṇākṣiyugalenasi 
gaṃḍayoroṣṭayordantapaṃktyorāsyenyasetsvarān 
cibukethagalekaṃṭhepārśvayoḥstanayugmake 
dormūlayoḥkurparayoḥpāṇyostatpṛṣṭadeśataḥ 
nābhauguhyepunaścorvojānunolaṃghayordvayoḥ 

<pṛ0 3a> kādirānyānyasedvarṇānsthāneṣveṣvasamāhitaḥ 
kaṭyāṃgrīveyakepaścātkaṭakohṛdiguhyake ka
rṇakuṃḍalayormaulaulavaḍānsākṣaśīrṣakau a
ṣṭāvimāpravinyasedevaṃdaiśikasattamaḥ evaṃ
nyastaśarīrosaudhyāyettripurabhairavīṃ oṃudyadbhā
nusahasrakāṃtimaruṇakṣaumāṃśiromālikāṃ
raktāliptapayodharāṃ japavaṭīṃvidyāmabhītiṃ
varāṃ hastābjairdadhatrīṃtrinetravisaska(?)dvaktrāraviṃ
daśriyaṃdevīṃvaddhahimāṃśuratnamukuṭāṃvandesamaṃda
smitāṃ dīkṣāṃprāpyajapenmantraṃtatvalakṣyaṃjiteṃ
driyaḥ puṣpaibhānuḥsahasrāṇijuhvayādbrahmavṛ
kṣajaiḥ trimadhvāktaiḥprasūnairvākaravīrasamudbhavaiḥ 
padmaṃvasudalopeteṃnavayonyāḍhyakarṇikaṃ icchā
diśaktibhiryuktaṃbhairavyāḥpīṭhamarcayet icchā

<pṛ0 3ba> jñānākriyāpaścātkāmanīkāmadāyinī ratīra
tipriyānandānavamosyānmanonmanī varadābha
yadyāriṇyāḥsaṃproktānavaśaktayaḥ vāgbhavaṃlo
hitorāyaiḥśrīkaṃṭholohitonalaḥ dīrghavāṇyai
parāpaścādaparāyaihasauṃpunaḥ sadāśivamahāpre
taṃṅentaṃpadmāsanaṃnamaḥ anenamanunādadyādāsa
naṃśrīkurukramaṃ prāṅmadhyayorantarālepūjayet 
kalpayettataḥ paṃcabhiḥpraṇavairmūrtiṃtasyāmā
vāhyadevatāṃ pūjayedāgamoktenavidhānenasa
māhitaḥ (paṃcabhiḥpraṇavai) tāravākvaktika
malāhasakhaphreṃhasoḥsmṛtaḥ vāmakoṇeyaje
ddevyāratimiṃdusamaprabhāṃ natipāśadharaṃsau
myāṃmadavibhramavihvalāṃ prītiṃdakṣiṇakoṇa
sthāṃtaptakāṃcanasannibhāṃ aṃkuśaṃpraṇatiṃdorbhyāṃ

<pṛ0 4a> dhārayaṃtīsamarcayet agremanobhavāṃraktaṃraktapu
ṣpādyalaṃkṛtāṃ ikṣukārmukapuṣpeṣudhāriṇīṃ
saṃsmitānanāṃ aṃgānyabhyarcayetpaścādyathāpūrvaṃvi
dhānavit ikṣvagrecanijairmantraiḥpūjayedbāṇadeva
tāḥ hastābjaiḥdhṛtapuṣpeṣupraṇāmābhūtasaprabhāḥ 
aṣṭayoniṣvaṣṭaśaktīḥpūjayetsubhagādikāḥ 
madhū(?)robhairavāṃkasthāmadavibhramavihvalāḥ a
ṣṭapatreṣusaṃpūjyāyathāvatkusumādibhiḥ loka
pālāṃstatodikṣuteṣāmastrāṇitadvahiḥ pū
rvajanmakṛtaiḥpuṇyairjñātvaināṃparadevatāṃ yoja
yeduktamārgeṇasabhavetsaṃpadāṃpadaṃ evaṃsiddha
manuṃmaṃtrīsādhayediṣṭamātmanaḥ juhvayādaruṇā
mbhojairadoṣairmadhunāplutaiḥ lakṣyasaṃkhyāṃtadardhaṃ
vāpratyahaṃbhojayeddvijān vanitāṃyuvatīramyāḥ

<pṛ0 4ba> prīṇayeddevatādhiyā homantedhanadhānyādyai
stoṣayedgurumātmanaḥ evaṃkṛtejagadvaśyora
māyābhavanaṃbhavet raktotpalaistrimadhvāktaira
ruṇaircāhayāriṇaiḥ puṣpaiḥpayodyauḥ(?)saghṛtairho
mādviśvaṃvaśaṃnayet vāksiddhiṃlabhatemaṃtrīpa
lāśakusumairbhavet karpūrāgurusaṃyuktaṃguggulaṃ
juhuyādvaśī jñānaṃdivyamavāpnotitenaivasabha
vetkaviḥ kṣīrāktairamṛtākhaṃḍairhomaḥsarvāpamṛ
tyujit dūrvābhirāyuṣaihomaḥkṣīrāktābhirdi
natrayaṃ kṣīrikarṇābhavaiḥpuṣpaivrāhmaṇānvaśaye
dbhutāt kalhāraiḥpārthivānpuṣpaistadvadhūḥkarṇi
kārajaiḥ mallikākusumaiḥhutvārājaputrānvaśaṃ
nayet koraṃdukusumairveśyānvṛṣalānpāṭalo
dbhavaiḥ anulomevilomāntaḥsthitassādhyāhva

<pṛ0 5a> yānvitaṃ maṃtramuccāryajuhuyārmaṃtrīmadhuralo
hitaiḥ sarṣapairmadhurāmiśrairvaśayetpārthivānkṣaṇā
t anenaivavidhānenatatpatnīstatsutānapi jā
tivilodbhavaipuṣpairmadhuratrayasaṃyutaiḥ naranārī
narapatīhomatovaśayeddhruvaṃ mālatīvakulodbhū
taiḥpuṣpaiścandanalohitaiḥ juhuyātkavitāṃmaṃ
trīlabhatevatsarāntare madhuratrayasaṃyuktaiḥphalai
rbilvasamudbhavaiḥ juhuyādvaśayellokāṃśriyamā
pnotivāñchitāṃ pāṭalaiḥkumudaiḥkundairutpalai
nāgacampakaiḥ nandyāvartaivikasitaiḥkṛtamā
lyairjuhotiyaḥ jāyatevatsarādarvākkriyāvi
jitapārthivaḥ sājyamannaṃprajuhvayādbhavedannasa
mṛddhimān kastūrīkuṃkumopetaṃkarpūraṃjuhuyā
dvaśī kandarpadadhikaṃsadyaḥsaubhāgyamadhigacchati 

<pṛ0 5ba> lājānprajuhvayārmaṃtrīdadhikṣīramadhuplutān vi
jityarogānakhilānsajīveccharadāṃśataṃ pāda
dvayaṃmalayajaṃpādaṃkuṃkumakesaraṃ pādaṃgoroca
naṃtānitrīṇipiṣṭāhimāṃbhasā vidadyāttila
kaṃbhāleyātpārśyedyaivilokyate yāvatspṛśetspṛ
śyatevaivaśyāḥsyustasyatecirāt karpūrakapi
caurāṇisamabhāgānikalpayet caturbhāgāja
ṭāmāṃsītāvatīrocanāmatā kuṃkumaṃsaptabhā
gaṃsyāddvibhāgaṃcandanaṃmataṃ agururnnavabhāgaḥsyā
ditibhāgakrameṇaca himādbhiḥkanyakāpi
ṣṭametatsarvaṃsusādhitaṃ ādāyatilakaṃbhā
lekuryādbhūmipatīnnarān vanitāmadagarvā
ḍhyāṃmadormattānmataṃgajān siṃhavyāghrānma
hāsarpānbhūtavetālarākṣasān darśanādevava

<pṛ0 6a> śayeddhāraṇāttilakasyavai madhyādyāṃnavayo
niṣupravilikhedvījānivarṇāstriśogāyatryāḥ
punaraṣṭapattravivareṣvālikhyalipyāvṛtaṃ bhūbi
mvadvitayenamanmathayujākoṇeṣusaṃveṣṭitaṃ 
yaṃtraṃtraipuramīritaṃtribhuvanaprakṣobhakaṃśrīpadaṃ 
asminyaṃtresamāvāhyasasyaḥsaṃpūjyadevatām 
homenakṛtasaṃpātalākṣālohatrayānvitām 
vidhṛtaṃbāhunāyantraṃyuddheṣuvijayāvahaṃ vāde
vāvijayaṃkuryātkavitvaṃpuṣkalaṃdiśet ā
yurārogyamitrāṇiputrapautrānvivardhayet 
kāmaṃṣaṭkoṇamadhyelikhatapunaramuṃṣa
ṇmukhoṇeṣupaścātpatreṣudvaṣṭa(?)saṃkhyeṣvamu
pathaparatovyomavījenavītaṃ kṣoṇībi
mbāntarasthaṃbhujadalalikhitaṃrocanāṃkuṃ
kamābhyaṃ proktaṃ

<pṛ0 6ba> saubhāgyasaṃpattirupasakavitārkīrtidaṃyaṃtra
metat vahnergehayugāṃtarasthamadanemāyāṃli
khevāgbhavaṃṣaṭkoṇeṣvathasaṃdhiṣupravilikhe
ddhūṃkāramāveṣṭayet strīkṣāṇenasamīritaṃ
tribhuvaṇmanuprakṣobhanaṃtraipuraṃyaṃtraṃpaṃcamano
bhavātmakamidaṃsaundaryasampatkaraṃ adharoviṃdu
stānādyaṃbrahmendrasthaḥśaśīyutaḥ dvitīyaṃ
bhṛgusargāḍhyomanustārtīyamīritaṃ eṣa
vāletivikhyātātrailokyavaśakāriṇī 
japapūjādikaṃsarvamasyāḥpūrvavadācaret 
mānmathaṃtripurādevividmahepadamaścaret 
utkāmeśvarīpadaṃpravadeddhīmahetataḥ tadaṃte
pravadedbhūyastannaḥklinnepracodayāt gāya
tryeṣāsamākhyātātripurīsarvasiddhidā stu

<pṛ0 7a> tyānayātvāṃtripurestauṣebhīṣṭaphalāptaye 
yayāvrajantitāṃlakṣmīṃmanujāsurapūji
tāḥ itiśrītripurabhairavīpaṭalaṃsamāptam oṃśrīdevyainamaḥ oṃtatraśrīmānsādha
kovrāhmemuhūrteśayanatalādutthāya kara
caraṇauprakṣālyanijāsanesamupaviśya
nijaśirasiśvetavarṇāsahasradalakala
karṇikāntargata candramaṃḍaloparisvagu
ruṃśuklavarṇaṃśuklālaṃkārabhūṣitaṃ jñā
nānandamuditamānasaṃsaccidānaṃdavigrahaṃ 
trinayanaṃcaturbhujaṃ jñānamudrāpustakava
rābhayakaraṃ vāmāṃgevāmahastadhṛtakama
layāraktavasanābharaṇayāsvaśaktyādakṣiṇa
bhujenāliṃgitaṃ sarvadevādidevaṃparamaśiva
svarūpaṃśāntaṃsvaprasannaṃdhyātvā taccaraṇaka
malayugalavigaladamṛtadhārayā |

<pṛ0 7ba> svātmānaṃplutaṃvibhāvyamānasopacārairārā
dhayedyathā laṃbhūmyātmakaṃgaṃdhasamarpayāmi
namaḥ hamākāśātmakaṃpuṣpaṃ yaṃvāyvātmakaṃdhūpaṃ raṃvahnyātmakaṃdīpaṃ vaṃamṛtātma
kaṃnānānaisaṃsarvātmakaṃphalamūlatāmbū
lādikaṃ samabhyarcya oṃaiṃhrīṃśrīṃhasa
khaphreṃ hasarakṣamalavayūṃsahakhaphreṃhasa
rakṣamalavaraya ūṃhsauṃshauḥśrīmacchrīamu
kānandanāthaśrīpādukāṃśrīśivāmbāṃ
pādukāṃpūjayāminamaḥ itidaśadhāvi
mṛṣya manasādaṃḍapraṇāmaṃkuryāt tatrapra
ṇāmamaṃtrādyathā|| oṃnamāmisadguruṃ
śāṃtaṃpratyakṣaṃśivarūpiṇaṃ śirasāyo
gapīṭhasthaṃmuktikāmārthasiddhaye (1)śrī
guruṃparamānandaṃvandāsyānandavigrahaṃ 

<pṛ0 8a> yasyasānidhyamātreṇacidānaṃdāyateparaṃ (2)
akhaṃḍamaṃḍalākāraṃvyāptaṃyenacarācaraṃ 
tatpadaṃdarśitaṃyenatasmaiśrīguravenamaḥ (3)
ajñānatimirāndhasyajñānāṃjñānaśilā
kayā cakṣurunmīlitaṃyenatasmaiśrī (4)
gururvrahmāguruḥviṣṇurgurusākṣānmaheśva
raḥ gurarevajagatsarvaṃtasmaiśrī (5)nama
stenāthabhagavanśivāyagururūpiṇe 
vidyāvatārasaṃsiddhyaisvīkṛtānekavi
graha navāyanavarūpāyaparamārthaikarūpiṇe 
sarvājñānatamobhedabhānavecidghanāyate 
svataṃtrāya dayākḷptavigrahāyaparātma
ne parataṃtrāyabhaktānāṃbhavyānāṃbhavarūpi
ṇe vivekināṃvivekāyavimarśāyavimarṣināṃ 

<pṛ0 8ba> prakāśināṃprakāśāyajñānināṃjñāna
rūpiṇe purastātpārśayopṛṣṭenamasku
ryātmuparyadaḥ sadāsaccitarūpeṇavidhe
hibhavadāsanaṃ itiśrīguruṃpraṇamya su
prasannaṃvibhāvya manasātadājñāṃgṛhītvā 
mūlādhāre svarṇavarṇacaturdalakama
lakarṇikāntargatatrikoṇacakrāntarga
taśṛṃgāṭakopariparāṃśaktiṃkuṃḍalinīṃ
mudyaddinakarasahasrabhāsvarāṃ vidyut
koṭisahasrābhāṃsakalamaṃtramātaraṃsarva
prāṇijīvāṃ tridhāmadhāmānaṃsarpākā
ramūrdhvamukhīṃsārdhatrivalayāṃmūrdhamukhī
visatantuṃtanīyasīṃ paṃcāśadvarṇavigrahāṃ aṣṭā

<pṛ0 9a> triṃśatkalārūpiṇīṃsvapnāṃvibhāvya gu
rūpadiṣṭanijasahajanādenaprabodhayi
tvā tatracaturdaleṣu vaṃnamaḥ| śaṃ| ṣaṃ| saṃ| 
itipatreṣu madhye mūle nacaprādakṣiṇye
nasaṃpūjya haṃsitimaṃtreṇa sarvatotthā
pya kāmakalātkamalaṃnītvā tatosvā
dhiṣṭhāneliṃgamūlevidrumavarṇeṣaṭdala
kamaletvāṃnītvā tatra vaṃnamaḥ| bhaṃ| maṃ| 
yaṃ| raṃ| laṃ| itipatreṣumadhyemūlenacasaṃ
pūjya tatomaṇipūrakenā bhaunīlava
rṇedaśadalakamaletāṃnītvā tatraduṃna
maḥ| ḍhaṃ| ṇaṃ| taṃ| thaṃ| daṃ| dhaṃ| naṃ| paṃ| phaṃ| 
itimantreṣumadhyemūle nacasampūjya| 

<pṛ0 9ba> tatovakṣasyanāhatepiṃgalavarṇedvādaśa
kamaletāṃnītvā tatrakaṃnamaḥ| khaṃ| gaṃ| ghaṃ 
ṅaṃ| caṃ| chaṃ| jaṃ| jhaṃ| ñaṃ| ṭaṃ| ṭhaṃ| itipattreṣu
madhyemūlenacasaṃpūjya tatoviśuddhauka
ṭhedhūmravarṇeṣoḍaśadalakamaletāṃnītvā 
tatra| aṃnamaḥ| āṃ| iṃ| ī| uṃ| ūṃ| ṛṃ| ṛṃ| ḷṃ 
ḹṃ| eṃ| aiṃ| oṃ| auṃ| aṃ| aḥ| yatipatreṣumadhye
mūlenacasampūjya tatobhrūmadhyeājñāca
krevidyudvarṇedvidalakamaletāṃnītvā| 
tatrahaṃnamaḥ| kṣaṃnamaḥ| itipatreṣumadhyemū
lenacasaṃpūjya tataḥsahasradalakamala
karṇikāntargatabindurūpatejomayapara
maśivenasahaikatāṃnītvā tenāmṛte
natataḥsravatāṃsaṃtarpya tatranādaśravaṇa

<pṛ0 10a> tatparomuhūrtaṃlayaṃvibhāvya punarapita
thājñācakrādikrameṇateṣukamaleṣutai
stairakṣaraiḥsampūjya sohaṃitimaṃtreṇamū
lādhāresvasthānesthāpayedityārohāva
rohakrameṇaparāṃdevīṃkuṃḍalinīṃdhyātvā 
prāṇāyāmṛṣyādikaraṣaḍganyāsadhyā
nānivakṣyamāṇakrameṇakṛtvā yathā
śaktijapaṃvidhāya punarapiprāṇāyā
mṛṣyādikaraṣaḍgādinājapaṃsamarpya 
itinijakṛtyaṃsamarpya prātaḥprabhṛtisā
